# Teachable


> Teachable is an all-in-one platform that helps creators, entrepreneurs, and educators build and sell online courses, coaching programs, and digital downloads.


Teachable enables anyone to monetize their knowledge by creating professional learning experiences without technical expertise. The platform serves both individual creators and businesses looking to educate customers or employees.


## Core Products


- **Online Courses**: Build structured, self-paced or cohort-based courses with video, quizzes, and certificates
- **Digital Downloads**: Sell ebooks, templates, presets, and other digital files
- **Coaching**: Offer 1:1 or group coaching sessions integrated with course content
- **Memberships**: Create recurring revenue with subscription-based access


